      "name": "Will my insurance pay for storm cleanup?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Cleanup of debris from a covered loss event — a tree on the house, vehicle damage, fence damage — is typically covered. Cleanup of debris that hasn't damaged a covered structure is generally a homeowner expense. Roubic provides a documentation breakdown so you can submit the covered portion to your carrier and pay the out-of-pocket portion separately." }
